<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκηρ-ύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκήρ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>proclaim by voice of herald</i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέκυν ἀστοῖσί φασιν ἐκκεκηρῦχθαι τὸ
					μὴ τάφῳ καλύψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>banish by proclamation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.21.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.97
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πόλεως, ἐκ τῆς πόλεως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.258
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.3
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ γένους ἐκκεκηρῦχθχι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				929b
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεκηρύχθην φυγάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					430
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cashier, 'drum out'</i> of the army, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				61.2
			</span></i>.</div>
